# Test: OSPFv2 TE LSA withdraw (RFC 3630 / RFC 2328 sec 14, spec-ospf-ext-2).
#
# VALIDATES: after a TE Link LSA is installed in the TED, a MaxAge purge delivered by the
# carrier (Withdrawn) removes the corresponding TED entry.
# PREVENTS: a withdrawn / MaxAged TE LSA leaving a stale TED entry.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=go test -v ./internal/plugins/ospf -run TestOSPFTEWithdrawFunctional -count=1:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=PASS
